Package: qemu-device-sdk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libglib2.0-dev (>= 2.56)
Description: QEMU Device Module Development SDK
 Headers and configuration files for building QEMU device modules
 as external shared libraries.
 .
 This package enables developers to create custom device models for
 QEMU without modifying or recompiling QEMU itself. Device modules
 use the same QOM (QEMU Object Model) and QDEV APIs as built-in
 devices, but are compiled separately and loaded at runtime.
 .
 The SDK includes:
  * All public API headers from QEMU
  * Generated configuration (config-host.h)
  * Generated QAPI type definitions
  * pkg-config integration
 .
 Use cases:
  * Custom hardware modeling
  * Rapid prototyping
  * Educational purposes
  * Proprietary IP distribution
